WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
Let's talk about why we're washing our
hands, right? How many of you

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.710
have tried to cook? And if you cook, like say you make a grilled cheese

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:12.210
and I like to make my grilled cheese with
like a lot of butter in the pan, and so

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:17.340
it ends up my pan after I eat my grilled
cheese my pan is full of like butter and

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.720
grease, right? Does anybody
feel-- seen-- that before? Like a pan is

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.699
like really greasy from like cooking
food? Well, if I were to take that pan and

00:00:26.699 --> 00:00:34.759
run it under water would it clean the
pan? Just plain water. What do you think?

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:40.649
No, right? You can't just take a bunch of
grease on a pan and put it under water

00:00:40.649 --> 00:00:49.180
and expect it to be clean. You have to
add something. What do you have to add?

00:00:49.240 --> 00:01:00.140
Yeah, go ahead. Some sort of soap or some natural, like, cleanser. Yeah, a cleaning product

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.100
like a soap, right? And, that's because the molecules inside of butter

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.960
like it's a special
kind of fat, right? They're actually the

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:16.110
same type of molecules that surround the
Coronavirus, and so if we see that our

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.900
soap is dissolving all of the fat inside
of our pan and making our pans clean,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:27.119
then it makes a lot of sense that soap
can also dissolve the fat that surrounds

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:31.860
the Coronavirus to get the Coronavirus
sort of like off of your -- off of your

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:38.159
hands. So, that's a really good-- we always
need to wash our hands. I know I have to

00:01:38.159 --> 00:01:42.450
use lotion now because my hands are so
dry because I'm always washing my hands,

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.399
and so that's really really important

